The MMCME4 cell u_camera_hdmi/u_hdmi/u_phy/u_vphy/inst/gt_usrclk_source_inst/rx_mmcm.rxoutclk_mmcm0_i/mmcm_adv_inst driven by BUFG_GT cell u_camera_hdmi/u_hdmi/u_phy/u_vphy/inst/gt_usrclk_source_inst/bufg_gt_gtrefclk0_odiv2_inst uses CLKOUT* output(s) with a DIVIDE value of [1..8] which could be accomplished using a BUFG_GT divide capability. Consider using BUFG_GT(s) to accomplish the desired divide(s).
Related violations: <none>

CLKC-11#2 Advisory
MMCME4 divide could be done by BUFG_GT  
The MMCME4 cell u_camera_hdmi/u_hdmi/u_phy/u_vphy/inst/gt_usrclk_source_inst/tx_mmcm.txoutclk_mmcm0_i/mmcm_adv_inst driven by BUFG_GT cell u_camera_hdmi/u_hdmi/u_phy/u_tx_refclk_bufg/U0/USE_BUFG_GT.GEN_BUFG_GT[0].BUFG_GT_U uses CLKOUT* output(s) with a DIVIDE value of [1..8] which could be accomplished using a BUFG_GT divide capability. Consider using BUFG_GT(s) to accomplish the desired divide(s).
Related violations: <none>

CLKC-40#1 Advisory
Substitute PLLE4 for MMCME4 check  
The MMCME4 cell u_camera_hdmi/u_hdmi/u_phy/u_vphy/inst/gt_usrclk_source_inst/rx_mmcm.rxoutclk_mmcm0_i/mmcm_adv_inst has a single input clock whose source driver, BUFG_GT u_camera_hdmi/u_hdmi/u_phy/u_vphy/inst/gt_usrclk_source_inst/bufg_gt_gtrefclk0_odiv2_inst, is not optimally located and the MMCM has a configuration which could be accommodated by a PLL.  Consider changing the MMCM to a PLL which could align better with the input clock driver.
Related violations: <none>

CLKC-56#1 Advisory
MMCME4 with global clock driver has no LOC  
The MMCME4_ADV cell u_camera_hdmi/u_camera_subsystem/u_camera_clocking/u_ov7670_clk_wiz/inst/mmcme4_adv_inst CLKIN1 or CLKIN2 pin is driven by global Clock buffer(s) u_control_soc/u_ref_clk_100m_bufg and does not have a LOC constraint. It is recommended to LOC the MMCM and use the CLOCK_DEDICATED_ROUTE constraint on the net(s) driven by the global Clock buffer(s).
Related violations: <none>

